Name: Show Sidebar
Type: Alias
Pattern: sb

Description: On mobile and tablets the sidebar is hidden, but sometimes I wanna see the magic map and the comms window!

Execute the following javascript:

//toggles sidebar
let sb = $("#sidebar")[0];
let main = $("#main")[0];
if(sb.style.display === "block") { //hide
    main.style.width = "100%";
    sb.style.display = "none";
} else { //show sidebar
    main.style.width = "60%";
    sb.style.display = "block";
    sb.style.top = "40px"; 
}
